OL,3,GNEWSATeacher 'protected' pupil by
OL,4,Arejecting pronouns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who was sacked for refusing
OL,7,Fto use a student's chosen pronouns
OL,8,Fbelieved he had a duty to safeguard the
OL,9,Fstudent by discouraging it, a tribunal
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FKevin Lister was dismissed by New
OL,13,FCollege Swindon in September 2022 for
OL,14,Fgross misconduct. The maths teacher has
OL,15,Fdescribed transgender ideology as a
OL,16,F"cult".
OL,18,FHe refused to use the 17-year-old
OL,19,Fpupil's preferred male name and
OL,20,Fpronouns, instead "gesturing" at them
OL,21,Fand writing their birth name on the
OL,22,Fclass whiteboard.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
